            Node("lookup", "lookup", "Propose exactly eight original decoder receipts",
                "The transparent selector proposes the eight listed fuel-index pairs and returns no receipt elsewhere. ExactMemo.memoStep independently checks the whole key before reuse, so selector correctness is not a soundness premise.", DescribeRole.Definition),
            Node("memo-nodes", "memoNodes", "Use literals on certified hits and the original decoder on every miss",
